    "status": "present",
    "value": "Use the same directory tree as variant 1, but now an operation sets either one file or an entire directory subtree to a chosen state, encrypted or decrypted. When operations overlap, the one applied to the deeper (more specific) node wins, so a directory can be encrypted and then individual files or subdirectories inside it decrypted. All files start decrypted. Return the minimum number of operations after which every file is in the state given by its flag."
  },
